You can have multiple versions of S-PLUS open with different projects,
using the /MULTIPLEINSTANCES flag on both shortcuts.  (For some reason,
that is buried in the Programmer's Manual.)  You could probably also attach
the "c:\SPLUSTS" chapter and detach it later.

