>sequential trials  with about 100 interim analyses?

Yes.  For example:

myDesign <- seqDesign(prob.model = "proportions", arms = 2,
  null.hypothesis = 0.3, alt.hypothesis = 0.31,
  nbr.analyses = 100)

Caveat -- some of the default plots will look ugly with this many analyses.

