> appears as a title of a column of the output of the
> function "add1", stands for?

It's not an abbreviation.  It is C sub p, as termed by Colin Mallows, and
eventually published in

C. L. Mallows (1973) Some comments on {$C_p$}. Technometrics 15, 661-675.

I believe you only see it from add1.lm.

Or see Venables & Ripley (1999, p. 185).

