From sundard at PDF.COM  Wed Mar 13 16:11:19 2002
From: sundard at PDF.COM (Sundar Dorai-Raj)
Date: Wed, 13 Mar 2002 10:11:19 -0600
Subject: Re: Number of digits after decimal in labels on axis in a graph
References: <20020313142852.85804.qmail@web11508.mail.yahoo.com>
Message-ID: <3C8F7A27.E7147872@pdf.com>

Look at axis() in the help files. Below is an example:

# plot data but suppress default axes
plot(x=x,y=y,axes=F)
# add x-axis, round values to 1 decimal place
axis(side=1,at=pretty(x),labels=round(pretty(x),1))
# add default y-axis
axis(side=2)
# add surrounding box
box()

There may be other slicker solutions but this one works fine.

Sundar

