"red", "yellow" are X11 color names (from rgb.txt).

"red 8 yellow" refers to a sequence of 10 colors: red, yellow, and 8
shades evenly graduated in between. "red 8 yellow 8 green 8 cyan 8 blue
8 magenta" is a sequence of 46 colors across the visible spectrum.

Detailed information can be found in the S-PLUS 6 for Unix User's Guide,
Chapter 7 "Working With Graphics Devices".

