I'd like to thank to all who answered me on my 
question regarding splitting the data.frame by indicator variable. 

 

Two possibilities are:

 

1. foo is a data.frame, and ind is an indicator 
column-variable in it. 

foo1_foo[foo$ind==1,]

foo2_foo[foo$ind==0,]

 

2. Using 

split(foo,foo$ind) will produce the list containing 
two data.frames with ind=1 and ind=0 accordingly. 

 

Vicky. 

